From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: KB <kb@kb-rpcs3.example>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 02:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] PS5: sample SPU reservation callback, wait and notifications

Measure exact callback/wait/notification invocation counts with relaxed
atomics; time only one of 128 calls per worker/event using monotonic
and per-thread CPU clocks. Report cumulative counts every 4 seconds,
not destructive exchange. Includes nested costs; no emulation changes.
No helper SPU gate changes and no claimed FPS optimization.

---
